    "committer": "GitHub <noreply@github.com>",
    "message": "Replace scran::summaryMarkerStats() to fix deprecation warnings (#127)\n\n* Replace scran::summaryMarkerStats() to fix deprecation warnings\n\nsummaryMarkerStats() calls scuttle's deprecated sumCountsAcrossCells()\nand numDetectedAcrossCells(), triggering an R CMD check WARNING on Bioc\ndevel. Compute the same per-group summary stats directly with\nscrapper::aggregateAcrossCells().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Bump version to 1.11.3\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Update NEWS for 1.11.3\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
    "time": 1795105707
  },
